#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure_stack/azure_stack.rst:7
msgid ""
"Azure Stack is Microsoft's Azure Cloud for on-premises environments. "
"Azure Stack contains the core Azure services, allowing organizations to "
"take advantage of Azure's offerings with the security, compliance, and "
"financial benefits of hosting it in their own data-centers."
msgstr "O Azure Stack é a Azure Cloud da Microsoft para ambientes on-premises. O Azure Stack contém os serviços principais do Azure, permitindo que as organizações ofereçam serviços Azure a partir de seu próprio datacenter."

